                                                "sense_id": "45c52822-d764-3bdb-812d-d5abbebd1ec9",
                                                "text": "[…] a school of landscape studies identified with the late John Brinkerhoff Jackson^([sic]) and Harvard’s Graduate School of Design. Jacksonesque landscape studies […]"
